<title>MALTA: GiroCredit registers Malta subsidiary.</title>
<headline>GiroCredit registers Malta subsidiary.</headline>
<dateline>VALLETTA 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>GiroCredit Bank Malta Limited, a subsidiary of GiroCredit Bank of Austria, has been registered by the Malta Financial Services Centre (MFSC) as an offshore bank to operate in Malta.</p>
<p>It is the fifth offshore bank in Malta and the third Austrian bank registered by the MFSC after First Austrian Bank and Volksbank.</p>
<p>The MFSC said GiroCredit Bank Malta will deal exclusively with non-residents and in foreign currency with foreign corporate and institutional clients.</p>
<p>GiroCredit has subsidiary banks in the Czech Republic, Hungary, Poland and Slovakia, representative offices in Hong Kong, Sydney, Zagreb, Milan and Madrid and branch offices in London and New York.</p>
</text>
